# Qt compiled translations. The shipped .qm files ARE committed so a fresh
# clone runs in Dari/Pashto without needing pyside6-lrelease; regenerate them
# after editing a .ts:  pyside6-lrelease <name>.ts -qm <name>.qm
*.qm
!mediflow/i18n/translations/*.qm

